  The derived benchmark is shared under CC BY-SA 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  Pinned source commits: config/dharma.lock.json. Details: benchmark/LICENSE and benchmark/DATA_CARD.md.
  Text from DHARMA editions also appears in app/web/src/samples/, app/web/src/practice/banks/,
  app/web/public/samples/ and eval/reports/, under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 terms and attribution.

